  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Below are the activities to be able to perform via GO.</p><p><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p>Upgrade the platform (to be used under directions from technical team)</p><p><strong>Deploy</strong></p><p>Deploy everything or just the configuration to a particular environment, flexibility to deploy on pre-prod and prod.</p><p><strong>Operate</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>(background) Take backup from passive to a well known location or configuration provided by the user</li><li>Clear http cache</li><li>Prepare production logs on demand. These logs are published as an artefact in Go after the job finishes.</li><li>Switch from active to passive</li><li>[TO DO LATER] Periodically delete orphan images uploaded (applicable to JSS, script not available yet for this)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Implementation Support</strong></p><p>Task to be triggered manually. Extract database dump, anonymise and publish the link.<br />Same as above except publish an empty database.</p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/11665409"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p>Below are the activities to be able to perform via GO.</p><p><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p>Upgrade the platform (to be used under directions from technical team)</p><p><strong>Deploy</strong></p><p>Deploy everything or just the configuration to a particular environment, flexibility to deploy on pre-prod and prod.</p><p><strong>Operate</strong></p><p> </p><ul><li>(background) Take backup from passive to a well known location or configuration provided by the user</li><li>Clear http cache</li><li>Prepare production logs on demand. These logs are published as an artefact in Go after the job finishes.</li><li>Switch from active to passive</li><li>[TO DO LATER] Periodically delete orphan images uploaded (applicable to JSS, script not available yet for this)</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong>Implementation Support</strong></p><p>Task to be triggered manually. Extract database dump, anonymise and publish the link.<br/>Same as above except publish an empty database.</p>",
